                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "q",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "(Required) Location query. Accepts: city name, lat/lon, US zip, UK postcode, Canada postal code, METAR code (metar:EGLL), IATA (iata:DXB), auto:ip, IPv4/IPv6, or location ID (id:2801268)."
